Since `ContextRanker` ranks contexts in descending order of their combined ranking scores, `"Highly important"` (0.85) should be ranked first (index 0) and `"Highly relevant"` (0.70) second (index 1). The test assertion expected the incorrect reverse order.

### How to Fix
Correct the test assertions in [test_context_ranker.py](file:///d:/nolqera/tests/test_context_ranker.py) to expect `"Highly important"` at rank index 0 (with score 0.85) and `"Highly relevant"` at rank index 1 (with score 0.70).

